A71D53C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "324216532323850", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222940_324216535657183_2732993496674239197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Cz_GcX-hVkQ7kNvwFi1fUc&_nc_oc=AdqVSrRnwCG5_X0yPXmGHZ-aA8Wip0eK7MAdX41irHgRwBMaQ3_UemhpTzI4FpQKUDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEBuNtHaF_TYs425xJU0aZm4T6nLRAmkGkbtpDJRm-Jng&oe=6A71E65A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "858182618298912", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_858182621632245_4461917798521767358_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b38qXu0gbrcQ7kNvwFXYamn&_nc_oc=AdoE1H9s2SYpAAZV50X4GsH6aeyLmTFtpa2XJulpbbWKKSmIMWcWfeeLcbnrhGENmtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLBZYry1mkzp2WES2C0WWvM0GD_kOhlP1DiQDZBlIjVw&oe=6A7201AA"}, "display_name": "VeeR: Premium Immersive Entertainment", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Looking for the best latest VR movies\uff1fVeeR have them all.\n\nWhat is special about VeeR:\n\n\u2022 PREMIUM TITLES: VR movies from award-winning studios and latest film festival line-ups\n\n\u2022 FRESH EXPERIENCES CURATED WEEKLY: We've got interactive movies, animations, Sci-Fi, travel & documentaries and so much more\n\n\u2022 HEAD-TRACKED SUBTITLES: Enjoy titles all around the world with English captions\n\n\u2022 ONLINE STREAMING & OFFLINE WATCHING up to 4K \n\n\u2022 VEER VR MOBILE APP:  With the mobile companion app, available on iOS & Android, you can preview and  bookmark titles during your commute or break time and watch later in a VR headset.\n\nDownload VeeR now and start watching!\n\nIf you like VeeR, please rate us and leave a review.\n\n*Any feedback or problems? \nReply within 48 hours: support@veer.tv \n\n*Follow us and stay tuned for new titles:\nFacebook: @letsveer \nTwitter: @letsveer", "short_description": "VeeR is a premium VR entertainment plat